 ## Background
-Voxel Billboard Rendering is described in the context of a cloud renderer implementation [S1, unofficial]. The specific implementation details, including the use of instanced rendering, CPU-side sorting, and the data structures involved, are derived from the `Cloud-Renderer` project by jaafersheriff [S1, unofficial]. The technique is presented as a method for visualizing volumetric data (specifically clouds) using geometry-based rendering rather than ray-marching or texture-based volume rendering.
